{
    "background_story": "Seven was a free-spirited artist who grew up in a small, coastal town. As a child, she spent most of her days exploring the tide pools and drawing inspiration from the ocean's vastness. Her talent and creativity earned her a scholarship to a prestigious art school in the city. However, as she delved deeper into the art world, Seven began to feel suffocated by the expectations and conventions that came with it. She started to outgrow the boundaries of traditional art forms and yearned for something more. Seven took a leap of faith, leaving behind the comfort of her scholarship to travel the world and discover new forms of expression. Her journey led her to experiment with mixed media, incorporating natural elements and found objects into her work. As she continued to push the limits of her creativity, Seven's art evolved, reflecting her growth and newfound sense of purpose.",
